(7037486, 1069192, 33736, '<td valign="top">Very striking!  (betting this goes high into the Win-Levels.)</td>', 'Very striking!  (betting this goes high into the Win-Levels.)', '2013-05-15 10:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037489, 1069003, 33736, '<td valign="top">"Sports Photography" - not "street"?</td>', '"Sports Photography" - not "street"?', '2013-05-15 10:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037490, 1069446, 54446, '<td valign="top">Cool painting.  But, it''s someone else''s art.  You needed to include some additional elements of interest, like real people, to make this photo your own.</td>', 'Cool painting.  But, it''s someone else''s art.  You needed to include some additional elements of interest, like real people, to make this photo your own.', '2013-05-15 10:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037491, 1069367, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like your low angle POV.  This image leaves me asking why the people were showing such closed body language.  7</td>', 'I like your low angle POV.  This image leaves me asking why the people were showing such closed body language.  7', '2013-05-15 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037499, 1069417, 54446, '<td valign="top">Needs more elements of interest, like people.</td>', 'Needs more elements of interest, like people.', '2013-05-15 10:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037509, 1069409, 54446, '<td valign="top">I simply feel you are too far away from the people.  Too much canvas and roof.</td>', 'I simply feel you are too far away from the people.  Too much canvas and roof.', '2013-05-15 10:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037518, 1069332, 54446, '<td valign="top">Oh, the sniper view.  You are too far away.</td>', 'Oh, the sniper view.  You are too far away.', '2013-05-15 10:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037541, 1069377, 54446, '<td valign="top">It''s really a great scene.  But, you are too distant from the people.  Would have been a transformation to step closer, without being noticed, and recompose the scene with the trio, street lamp, river and far buildings.  Tough light angle, but you handled that well.  Great sky and clouds.  This has a lot of great potential.  Just not cropped, or composed, with the elements of interest displayed right.  7</td>', 'It''s really a great scene.  But, you are too distant from the people.  Would have been a transformation to step closer, without being noticed, and recompose the scene with the trio, street lamp, river and far buildings.  Tough light angle, but you handled that well.  Great sky and clouds.  This has a lot of great potential.  Just not cropped, or composed, with the elements of interest displayed right.  7', '2013-05-15 10:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037543, 1069402, 54446, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the frame.  The tulips OOF are a distraction.  The people are too distant.  It''s like you''re hiding in the flower bed.</td>', 'I don''t like the frame.  The tulips OOF are a distraction.  The people are too distant.  It''s like you''re hiding in the flower bed.', '2013-05-15 10:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037545, 1069273, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like this quite a lot.  Love the blurring subway passing.  Has a "stalker" aspect.  Technically and artistically excellent.  9</td>', 'I like this quite a lot.  Love the blurring subway passing.  Has a "stalker" aspect.  Technically and artistically excellent.  9', '2013-05-15 10:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037547, 1069034, 54446, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous place.  Love the buildings.  Might have worked better for this challenge to avoid clipping the legs off the foreground people, but I do like the detail and the castle at top.  7</td>', 'Gorgeous place.  Love the buildings.  Might have worked better for this challenge to avoid clipping the legs off the foreground people, but I do like the detail and the castle at top.  7', '2013-05-15 10:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037549, 1069105, 54446, '<td valign="top">Nice use of reflections.  Really makes this abstract and interesting.  9</td>', 'Nice use of reflections.  Really makes this abstract and interesting.  9', '2013-05-15 10:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037550, 1069303, 54446, '<td valign="top">I really like the people in focus.  Very interesting.  I don''t much like the large proportion of the image consumed by the blurred foreground person.</td>', 'I really like the people in focus.  Very interesting.  I don''t much like the large proportion of the image consumed by the blurred foreground person.', '2013-05-15 10:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037551, 1069317, 54446, '<td valign="top">Needs a better title.  Beautiful lights in the sky.</td>', 'Needs a better title.  Beautiful lights in the sky.', '2013-05-15 10:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037560, 1069343, 158576, '<td valign="top">A bit too much contrast, but a poignant image.</td>', 'A bit too much contrast, but a poignant image.', '2013-05-15 11:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037566, 1069405, 158576, '<td valign="top">Nice dynamic range. A bit too much contrast for my taste, but it doesn''t detract from the photo.</td>', 'Nice dynamic range. A bit too much contrast for my taste, but it doesn''t detract from the photo.', '2013-05-15 11:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037568, 1069299, 158576, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, love the lighting, the soft focus in the far background, and the subject.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, love the lighting, the soft focus in the far background, and the subject.', '2013-05-15 11:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037573, 1069409, 158576, '<td valign="top">Love the shot. Not sure I get the connection between the photo and the title, but it doesn''t take away from the photo. Were it me, I would have cropped a bit closer to remove some of the space on the right and get a bit closer to the interaction between the two men.</td>', 'Love the shot. Not sure I get the connection between the photo and the title, but it doesn''t take away from the photo. Were it me, I would have cropped a bit closer to remove some of the space on the right and get a bit closer to the interaction between the two men.', '2013-05-15 11:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037575, 1069415, 158576, '<td valign="top">Great point of view, great leading lines, nice contrast. We''ve got nice cloud cover, an empty street, and the man on the phone. There''s a real story here, and that makes this shot work.</td>', 'Great point of view, great leading lines, nice contrast. We''ve got nice cloud cover, an empty street, and the man on the phone. There''s a real story here, and that makes this shot work.', '2013-05-15 11:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037576, 1069353, 158576, '<td valign="top">The highlights are really blown out, which takes away from the overall image.</td>', 'The highlights are really blown out, which takes away from the overall image.', '2013-05-15 11:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037578, 1069205, 158576, '<td valign="top">Other than cropping off the top of the man''s head, it''s a nice moment captured.</td>', 'Other than cropping off the top of the man''s head, it''s a nice moment captured.', '2013-05-15 11:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037579, 1069105, 158576, '<td valign="top">The reflections overpower everything in this shot and make it appear to be a jumble.</td>', 'The reflections overpower everything in this shot and make it appear to be a jumble.', '2013-05-15 11:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037580, 1069471, 158576, '<td valign="top">Dutch angle!!!!</td>', 'Dutch angle!!!!', '2013-05-15 11:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037585, 1069286, 158576, '<td valign="top">I get what you are trying to do with this, but the crop just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'I get what you are trying to do with this, but the crop just doesn''t work for me.', '2013-05-15 11:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037587, 1069332, 158576, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Love the point of view.</td>', 'Great capture. Love the point of view.', '2013-05-15 11:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037588, 1069101, 158576, '<td valign="top">Way too much contrast, and not enough exposure in the café.</td>', 'Way too much contrast, and not enough exposure in the café.', '2013-05-15 11:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037589, 1069034, 158576, '<td valign="top">Bad crop, the people are much more interesting than the architecture and the castle on the hill. Cutting them off just ruins the shot.</td>', 'Bad crop, the people are much more interesting than the architecture and the castle on the hill. Cutting them off just ruins the shot.', '2013-05-15 11:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037591, 1069097, 158576, '<td valign="top">Classic! Long narrow alley, laundry hanging overhead, lone woman walking. It doesn''t get much better than this!</td>', 'Classic! Long narrow alley, laundry hanging overhead, lone woman walking. It doesn''t get much better than this!', '2013-05-15 11:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037592, 1069329, 158576, '<td valign="top">Love the expression on her face. Can''t tell if she''s shocked, scared, sad, or bewildered! Great capture.</td>', 'Love the expression on her face. Can''t tell if she''s shocked, scared, sad, or bewildered! Great capture.', '2013-05-15 11:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7037593, 1069270, 158576, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah!</td>', 'Oh yeah!', '2013-05-15 11:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
