(7037841, 1069446, 106806, '<td valign="top">I may be wrong but I think that the best street photography captures people in the street .... I love this image because in that first micro second that the eye falls on this image one is duped into thinking it is picture of a man only a split second later do we realize it is a painting - the effect I think is entirely down to the way you have carefully framed this. Love it.</td>', 'I may be wrong but I think that the best street photography captures people in the street .... I love this image because in that first micro second that the eye falls on this image one is duped into thinking it is picture of a man only a split second later do we realize it is a painting - the effect I think is entirely down to the way you have carefully framed this. Love it.', '2013-05-15 18:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
