(7038125, 1068876, 158576, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but it doesn''t fit the definition of street photography, which doesn''t necessarily include people in the shot, but this leans more towards architectural and away from "street".</td>', 'Nice composition, but it doesn''t fit the definition of street photography, which doesn''t necessarily include people in the shot, but this leans more towards architectural and away from "street".', '2013-05-16 12:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7038126, 1069280, 158576, '<td valign="top">Cutting off his left hand and his feet are "rookie" mistakes. The blur on his right hand doesn''t add context so it just becomes a distraction. I see a guy reaching for coffee, but other than the tiny bit of amp barely visible behind his arm, nothing says he''s a musician. It just looks like a missed opportunity.</td>', 'Cutting off his left hand and his feet are "rookie" mistakes. The blur on his right hand doesn''t add context so it just becomes a distraction. I see a guy reaching for coffee, but other than the tiny bit of amp barely visible behind his arm, nothing says he''s a musician. It just looks like a missed opportunity.', '2013-05-16 12:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7038127, 1069462, 158576, '<td valign="top">Dutch angle just throws this off, and the pink tone doesn''t help. The challenge is Street Photography in Black and White, not pink and white...</td>', 'Dutch angle just throws this off, and the pink tone doesn''t help. The challenge is Street Photography in Black and White, not pink and white...', '2013-05-16 12:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
