(7039887, 1069447, 138253, '<td valign="top">a 10 from me for the absolutely stunning image.<br/>first image to make me really stop and see what''s going on. so many possible, wonderful stories, from the mundane to the everyday, and the impossible - all possible here.<br/> <br/>**addendum** just wanted to say that it was worth voting in order to see this image!</td>', 'a 10 from me for the absolutely stunning image.first image to make me really stop and see what''s going on. so many possible, wonderful stories, from the mundane to the everyday, and the impossible - all possible here. **addendum** just wanted to say that it was worth voting in order to see this image!', '2013-05-19 15:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039941, 1069345, 59740, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and contrast. It''s hard to tell what the subject is without the title.</td>', 'Good exposure and contrast. It''s hard to tell what the subject is without the title.', '2013-05-19 18:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039942, 1069097, 59740, '<td valign="top">I love it. BW is really the best way to shoot this type of scene because of the chaos. Nice work.</td>', 'I love it. BW is really the best way to shoot this type of scene because of the chaos. Nice work.', '2013-05-19 18:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039943, 1068998, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice try. Could use more contrast and shallower DOF to blur the busy background.</td>', 'Nice try. Could use more contrast and shallower DOF to blur the busy background.', '2013-05-19 18:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039944, 1069317, 59740, '<td valign="top">Appears to have more than one tone. I would crop some of the left side off. There is little detail in this part of the image anyway.</td>', 'Appears to have more than one tone. I would crop some of the left side off. There is little detail in this part of the image anyway.', '2013-05-19 18:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039945, 1069012, 59740, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. It almost seems as if he is juggling the people also.</td>', 'Interesting shot. It almost seems as if he is juggling the people also.', '2013-05-19 18:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039946, 1069034, 59740, '<td valign="top">The scene is too busy. My eyes don''t know where to look first. In addition the left side is too hot. I would have used a vertical ND filter to tone that side down. (don''t know if that''s allowed in PS in this category).</td>', 'The scene is too busy. My eyes don''t know where to look first. In addition the left side is too hot. I would have used a vertical ND filter to tone that side down. (don''t know if that''s allowed in PS in this category).', '2013-05-19 19:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039950, 1069374, 59740, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Could use a little more contrast and I would have cropped off everything to the right of the of the farthest people.</td>', 'Good capture. Could use a little more contrast and I would have cropped off everything to the right of the of the farthest people.', '2013-05-19 19:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039952, 1069403, 59740, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Too bad the foreground person is a little off focus. I would have made it a verticle by cropping off everything but the three people.</td>', 'Good idea. Too bad the foreground person is a little off focus. I would have made it a verticle by cropping off everything but the three people.', '2013-05-19 19:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039955, 1069393, 59740, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I think it would be even better if you were a little more to the right and the rings they are looking at were more visible.</td>', 'Great idea. I think it would be even better if you were a little more to the right and the rings they are looking at were more visible.', '2013-05-19 19:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039962, 1068996, 59740, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Unfortunately my attention is drawn to the blown out buildings on the left. My guess is that it was backlit and to get adequate exposure of the two people, the background became overexposed. If it weren''t street photography, fill flash would solve the problem.</td>', 'Interesting subject. Unfortunately my attention is drawn to the blown out buildings on the left. My guess is that it was backlit and to get adequate exposure of the two people, the background became overexposed. If it weren''t street photography, fill flash would solve the problem.', '2013-05-19 19:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039964, 1069112, 59740, '<td valign="top">Good but the left side is too bright drawing my eye away from the action.</td>', 'Good but the left side is too bright drawing my eye away from the action.', '2013-05-19 19:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039965, 1068991, 59740, '<td valign="top">I love abstracts but as a "street photograph" it''s hard to understand.</td>', 'I love abstracts but as a "street photograph" it''s hard to understand.', '2013-05-19 19:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039966, 1068848, 59740, '<td valign="top">I guess this is supposed to be paparazzi but they are too far away to really tell.</td>', 'I guess this is supposed to be paparazzi but they are too far away to really tell.', '2013-05-19 19:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039968, 1069373, 59740, '<td valign="top">I like this one. The only suggestion would be to crop off the guy on the left side.</td>', 'I like this one. The only suggestion would be to crop off the guy on the left side.', '2013-05-19 19:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039969, 1069446, 59740, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I think it would be a much better composition as a verticle by cropping off the right side at the edge of the doorway.</td>', 'Very interesting. I think it would be a much better composition as a verticle by cropping off the right side at the edge of the doorway.', '2013-05-19 19:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039970, 1069402, 59740, '<td valign="top">A good rule of thumb is that if you are using a foreground object to create depth, it has to be sharp. Your flowers are badly out of focus and are distracting.</td>', 'A good rule of thumb is that if you are using a foreground object to create depth, it has to be sharp. Your flowers are badly out of focus and are distracting.', '2013-05-19 19:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039972, 1069462, 59740, '<td valign="top">the picture is good. It doesn''t need the tint.</td>', 'the picture is good. It doesn''t need the tint.', '2013-05-19 19:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039973, 1069332, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but I think that the out of focus wires spoil it.</td>', 'Nice idea but I think that the out of focus wires spoil it.', '2013-05-19 19:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039974, 1069449, 59740, '<td valign="top">Without your title I wouldn''t have a clue.</td>', 'Without your title I wouldn''t have a clue.', '2013-05-19 19:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039976, 1069450, 59740, '<td valign="top">The out of focus foreground bagpipe players distract from the graduate whom I assume is the main subject.</td>', 'The out of focus foreground bagpipe players distract from the graduate whom I assume is the main subject.', '2013-05-19 19:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039977, 1069354, 59740, '<td valign="top">Your main subject doesn''t seem to be doing anything. Not too interesting to me.</td>', 'Your main subject doesn''t seem to be doing anything. Not too interesting to me.', '2013-05-19 19:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039978, 1069314, 59740, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Lots of composition problems but who cares.</td>', 'Great shot. Lots of composition problems but who cares.', '2013-05-19 19:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039979, 1069395, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I hope they all got across safely.</td>', 'Nice shot. I hope they all got across safely.', '2013-05-19 19:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039980, 1069067, 59740, '<td valign="top">Good action shot but looks a little too posed.</td>', 'Good action shot but looks a little too posed.', '2013-05-19 19:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039981, 1069192, 59740, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrast. I love it.</td>', 'Wonderful contrast. I love it.', '2013-05-19 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7039982, 1069406, 59740, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Would be much stronger if the persons face could be seen.</td>', 'Good idea. Would be much stronger if the persons face could be seen.', '2013-05-19 19:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
