(7039999, 1069343, 59740, '<td valign="top">I guess they are waiting for a bus and he is trying to make it. I think it would have been more forceful with a slow pan from the side to show some motion.</td>', 'I guess they are waiting for a bus and he is trying to make it. I think it would have been more forceful with a slow pan from the side to show some motion.', '2013-05-19 19:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7040000, 1069415, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure. Problem is that it is two photos. The bridge is unusual and attracts my attention from the man on the phone whose face I can''t see.</td>', 'Nice exposure. Problem is that it is two photos. The bridge is unusual and attracts my attention from the man on the phone whose face I can''t see.', '2013-05-19 19:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7040001, 1069455, 59740, '<td valign="top">Too busy and no main subject. The dog would be more forceful it you could see its face and if the building weren''t so overexposed.</td>', 'Too busy and no main subject. The dog would be more forceful it you could see its face and if the building weren''t so overexposed.', '2013-05-19 19:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7040002, 1069097, 68769, '<td valign="top">I might no want to live here, but I would love to be close enough to visit with camera. Easy 10.</td>', 'I might no want to live here, but I would love to be close enough to visit with camera. Easy 10.', '2013-05-19 19:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7040003, 1069433, 59740, '<td valign="top">Very interesting group of people. I think it could have been improved with more contrast and tighter cropping. I would crop off everything outside of the two men sitting on the ground and try to punch up the contrast.</td>', 'Very interesting group of people. I think it could have been improved with more contrast and tighter cropping. I would crop off everything outside of the two men sitting on the ground and try to punch up the contrast.', '2013-05-19 19:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
