(7040006, 1069273, 59740, '<td valign="top">Great intriguing shot. I''m troubled somewhat by the two bright horizontal lines. They look like a frame?</td>', 'Great intriguing shot. I''m troubled somewhat by the two bright horizontal lines. They look like a frame?', '2013-05-19 19:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
