(7040008, 1069283, 59740, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to see what he''s doing. If he is working on something it would be better to see his right hand.</td>', 'It''s hard to see what he''s doing. If he is working on something it would be better to see his right hand.', '2013-05-19 19:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
